# No Cursor commit trailers

Do **not** add Cursor attribution to commits or pull requests.

## Forbidden in commit messages and PR bodies

- `Made-with: Cursor`
- `Made with Cursor`
- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`
- Any `--trailer` flag for Cursor attribution
- Any similar Cursor/agent attribution line

## When committing

- Write plain commit messages only — subject and body the user requested, nothing else.
- Do not pass `--trailer` to `git commit`.
- Do not append attribution “helpfully” at the end of messages.

## When creating PRs

- Do not add Cursor attribution footers to `gh pr create --body`.

## Enforcement

This repo uses `.githooks/prepare-commit-msg` to strip Cursor trailers if they slip through. After clone:

```bash
git config core.hooksPath .githooks
```
